<title>USA: No threat of cold in Brazil coffee areas - WSC.</title>
<headline>No threat of cold in Brazil coffee areas - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's coffee-growing regions face no threat of cold in the next several days, independent forecaster Weather Services Corporation (WSC) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Low temperatures are seen at 54-63 degrees, it added.</p>
</text>
